
   QFront v1.0.0 — FidoNet Mailer for PCBoard 15.4
   ============================================================================

   Clean-room implementation by the pcbirc crew, 2026.
   License: GPLv3 — source code included.

   INCLUDED FILES:

   Programs:
     QFRONT.EXE      Main mailer (DOS4G)
     QFCONFIG.EXE    Configuration editor (DOS4G)
     QSCAN.EXE       EchoMail tosser/scanner (DOS4G)
     QNLIST.EXE      Nodelist compiler (DOS4G)
     QFUTIL.EXE      Utility program (DOS4G)
     DOS4GW.EXE      DOS4G extender stub

   Documentation:
     QFRONT.DOC      Sysop manual (38 pages)
     QFRONT-CFG.DOC  Configuration file reference
     HISTORY.DOC     Change history
     INSTALL.TXT     Quick installation guide for PCBoard
     README.1ST      This file

   Display files:
     NORMAL.TXT      Normal session display
     CRITICAL.TXT    Critical session display
     FAILED.TXT      Failed session display
     LOWBAUD.TXT     Low baud rate display
     AREAFIX.TXT     Areafix help text

   Configuration:
     qfront.cfg      Example configuration (edit for your system)
     QMAGIC.DAT      Magic filename aliases (optional)
     QRLIMIT.DAT     File request limits (optional)

   Source code:
     src/            Complete source (21 files, 10,123 lines)

   QUICK START:

   1. Copy files to C:\QFRONT
   2. Run QFCONFIG to set your address, paths, COM port
   3. Set up BOARD.BAT (see QFRONT.DOC page 7)
   4. Run BOARD.BAT

   See QFRONT.DOC for full documentation.

